abstract: >
  In-lab LLM captures against the OWASP LLM Top 10 2025 edition. The
  base Streamlit demo is Wenhan Kong (cda59f1). Seven live captures and
  three architectural notes sit on that base. That capture word is not
  Demonstrated on the dual-lab ladder. Live APIs are required to take a
  new capture.
